  "source": "DHM Quran Recitation (QRA1) · lesson 2. From Dr. Hassan's course; every word in his voice, every verse by Sheikh Al-Minshawi.",
  "title": {
    "ar": "الْفَتْحَةُ",
    "en": "Fatha"
  },
  "topic": "Read fatha and recite Surat Al-Fatihah",
  "minutes": 15,
  "learn": [
    {
      "en": "Fatha is a small slanting line above the letter. Read a short “a” on any letter. Letter plus fatha equals the letter's sound plus a.",
      "title": "Fatha"
    },
    {
      "en": "Listen to Sheikh Al-Minshawi recite Surat Al-Fatihah. Follow with your finger, then recite it yourself.",
      "title": "Surat Al-Fatihah",
      "ar": "بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ ﴿١﴾ ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ رَبِّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ ﴿٢﴾ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ ﴿٣﴾ مَٰلِكِ يَوْمِ ٱلدِّينِ ﴿٤﴾ إِيَّاكَ نَعْبُدُ وَإِيَّاكَ نَسْتَعِينُ ﴿٥﴾ ٱهْدِنَا ٱلصِّرَٰطَ ٱلْمُسْتَقِيمَ ﴿٦﴾ صِرَٰطَ ٱلَّذِينَ أَنْعَمْتَ عَلَيْهِمْ غَيْرِ ٱلْمَغْضُوبِ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا ٱلضَّآلِّينَ ﴿٧﴾",
      "aud": "c-1-ar"
    },
    {
      "en": "At the end of any gathering, the Prophet ﷺ advised us to say this du'aa: Glory is to You, O Allah, and praise. We bear witness that none has the right to be worshiped except You. We seek Your forgiveness and we turn to You in repentance.",
      "title": "At the end of our lesson",
      "ar": "سُبْحَانَكَ اللَّهُمَّ وَبِحَمْدِكَ، نَشْهَدُ أَنْ لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا أَنْتَ، نَسْتَغْفِرُكَ وَنَتُوبُ إِلَيْكَ",
      "aud": "c-2-ar",
      "tr": "Subhanaka Allahumma wa bihamdika, nashhadu an la ilaha illa anta, nastaghfiruka wa natubu ilayk"
    }
  ],
